      "text_raw": "For such applications a SAR ADC is used.\nIt consists of a Sample-and-hold at the input, to maintain a constant voltage during the\nconversion.",
      "text": "For such applications a SAR ADC is used. It consists of a Sample-and-hold at the input, to maintain a constant voltage during the conversion."
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 609,
